- He runs a Cricket club and is also the President of the Moon Light Cricket Club and Organised state-level Tennis Ball Cricket Tournament
- Runs Ladle Blaster sports club

- He s a Runner-Up Mayor{3rd Position in 2023 election}

- Zila Adhyaksh of Bihar State primary Sangh, Patna;
-Councilor of All India Primary Teacher Education, Delhi
-Ex- principal in Govt. Middle School & retired in 2016;
-Prominent Businessman and Landlord
-Pension from government

- Former Zila Parishad (2011).
- Incumbent Defacto ZP contested (2nd runner up, 7239)
-In 2006 contested for Zila Parishad but lost due to 11 votes;
-In 2011 contested for Zila Parishad and won
-In 2016 not contested -Former Zila Mahasachiv of JDU;
-Former Zila Adhyaksh of EBC(JDU).

- Incumbent three times PACs (2009;2014;2019 unopposed);
-Piprahi Vyapar Mandal three times Adhyaksh (2012;2017;2022)
-Seeds and Fertilizers Shop
